  {
   "etapa": "explicar",
   "piezas": [
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Tens and hundreds",
     "texto": [
      "To form 11–19, say **on** (ten) and then the unit: **on bir** (11), **on iki** (12), **on dokuz** (19).",
      "The tens are their own words: **yirmi, otuz, kırk, elli, altmış, yetmiş, seksen, doksan**. They are combined without «and»: **kırk iki** (42).",
      "**Yüz** means one hundred; **iki yüz** = two hundred."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Plural and quantity",
     "texto": [
      "The plural suffix is **-lar/-ler**: **kitaplar** (books), **evler** (houses). The vowel changes according to vowel harmony.",
      "After a number, the noun usually stays singular: **üç kitap** = three books, not *üç kitaplar*."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    }
   ]
